; Fast 1200mV 0C Model Hold: 'altera_reserved_tck'                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       ;
+-------+-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+---------------------+---------------------+--------------+------------+------------+
