; Fast 1200mV 0C Model Recovery: 'altera_reserved_tck'                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      ;
+--------+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+---------------------+---------------------+--------------+------------+------------+
